{"id":"msg_m_ex_botanikgarden_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_botanikgarden","label":"Botanic Garden · Group"},"label":"2. Flora!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_botanikgarden_01","next":null,"speakers":{"trina":"Trina","flora":"Flora"},"icons":{"trina":"si_c412_00_s","flora":"si_c411_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_1","text":"Flora!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_2","text":"Sun!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_3","text":"Are either of you busy right now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_4","text":"No, why?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_5","text":"I'm free too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_6","text":"What's up?✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_7","text":"Uh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_8","text":"One of the little ones I've been raising on my head","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_9","text":"has gone missing!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_10","text":"Did you look for them?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_11","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_12","text":"I searched the entire arboretum,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_13","text":"but I just couldn't find them anywhere :'(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_14","text":"Which of the four is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_15","text":"Hm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_16","text":"The small,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_17","text":"cute one","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_18","text":"with the white feathers.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_19","text":"???","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_20","text":"Does it have a bad case of RBF","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_21","text":"and always look a little mad?✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_22","text":"Yes! That one!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_23","text":"How in the world did you figure that out with so little information?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_24","text":"I've spent my fair share of time with them too,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_25","text":"so I've developed a real understanding of them.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_26","text":"Impressive.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_27","text":"Anyway, I'll go looking for them straight away.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_28","text":"Please wait for my update.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_29","text":"All right,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_30","text":"thank you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_31","text":"Is there any particular reason why I'm being included in this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_32","text":"Before my little birdie disappeared,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_33","text":"the last place I visited was the Commander's Room and the garden.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_34","text":"Okay, I understand.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_35","text":"I just checked the garden,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_36","text":"but didn't see anything.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_37","text":"I see...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_38","text":"Blossom,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_39","text":"could you spare a moment to help Trina?✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_40","text":"Please, Sun!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_41","text":"I need your help!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_42","text":"This room is so small. I don't see where it could possibly hide.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_43","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_43","text":"I look around my room for a moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_44","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_44","text":"...?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_45","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_45","text":"A white feather is sticking out of the cup that's placed on my desk.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_46","text":"I'm pretty sure I found its hiding spot.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_47","text":"Really?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_48","text":"What a relief!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_49","text":"I'm so glad to hear you found it!✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_50","text":"I'll keep them here with me. Do you want to come get it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_51","text":"Yes, I'll come right away!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_52","text":"I haven't got much going on, so I'll tag along.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_53","text":"Wait just a moment for us, Blossom.✿","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_botanikgarden_02_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_botanikgarden_02_54","text":"Sure, take your time.","jump":null}],"chat":true}